text Through the window, I look up at the clouds in the sky.
text I wonder if Furukawa is waiting on the grounds somewhere, a basketball held to her chest.
text I don't see anything like that from here.
text So I just keep staring into the gray abyss above.
text ...Hoping that it doesn't rain.
text It's the least I could pray for.
