text And I borrowed this too... I'll need to wipe it off before I return it.
text She looks down at the ball she's holding.
text @[Tomoya]
text The ball isn't gonna catch a cold. You need to be worried about yourself.
text @[Tomoya]
text Here, I'll let you borrow this umbrella. Just hurry up and get back home.
text I hold out the umbrella.
text Large raindrops start falling on my head.
sound GX1.aac
